# Tier 0, on the whole monorepo — not just the staged files.
#
# Deliberate (docs/testing.md, Tier 0): LLM-authored changes tend to leave
# unrelated files unformatted or half-edited, and a staged-files-only check is
# blind to exactly that. These are the same three commands CI runs, with no
# separate fast path, so a green commit means a green pipeline.
npm run typecheck
npm run lint
npm run format:check
